Subject: [PATCH] Preserve access profile type during metadata updates

Send the complete mutable-field mask for access profile updates. The API applies
only fields named by update_mask; type remains intentionally absent because the
provider replaces resources when a configured type changes. This permits
annotation and other metadata updates without accidentally invoking the API's
separate type-change contract.

diff --git a/internal/provider/access_profile_resource_sdk.go b/internal/provider/access_profile_resource_sdk.go
--- a/internal/provider/access_profile_resource_sdk.go
+++ b/internal/provider/access_profile_resource_sdk.go
@@ -326,8 +326,11 @@ func (r *AccessProfileResourceModel) ToSharedRequestCatalogManagementServiceUp
 		return nil, diags
 	}
 
+	updateMask := "annotations,description,displayName,enrollmentBehavior,published,requestBundle," +
+		"unenrollmentBehavior,unenrollmentEntitlementBehavior,visibleToEveryone"
 	out := shared.RequestCatalogManagementServiceUpdateRequest{
-		Catalog: catalog,
+		Catalog:    catalog,
+		UpdateMask: &updateMask,
 	}
 
 	return &out, diags
